Value DESCRIPTION (.+?)
Value INPUT_RATE_BPS (\d+)
Value INPUT_RATE_PPS (\d+)
Value OUTPUT_RATE_BPS (\d+)
Value OUTPUT_RATE_PPS (\d+)

Start
  ^\s*Description:\s+${DESCRIPTION}\s*$$
  ^\s*\d+ (?:second|minute)s? input rate ${INPUT_RATE_BPS} bits/sec,\s+${INPUT_RATE_PPS} packets/sec\s*$$
  ^\s*\d+ (?:second|minute)s? output rate ${OUTPUT_RATE_BPS} bits/sec,\s+${OUTPUT_RATE_PPS} packets/sec\s*$$ -> Record
